<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines cuts overnight lending to 14.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippines cuts overnight lending to 14.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Wednesday it had reduced its overnight lending rate to 14.0 percent from 15.0 percent.</p>
<p>The overnight borrowing rate was unchanged at 11.0 percent.</p>
<p>The Central Bank's overnight rates are used as a benchmark in the interbank call loan market.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
